<title>RUSSIA: Moscow to launch muni bonds Feb 19.</title>
<headline>Moscow to launch muni bonds Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The City of Moscow will launch its municipal bond programme on Feburary 19 with a 10 billion rouble issue of 182-day discount paper, the city's municipal loans and capital market development committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The city, joining a handful of Russian regions which regularly issue rouble paper, is planning to issue a total of 200 billion roubles of bills in the first stage of its borrowing programme.</p>
<p>Both residents and non-residents may bid for paper.</p>
<p>Details of the issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		    MF73-3-00155</p>
<p>    Issue volume		     10 billion roubles</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1 million roubles</p>
<p>    Tenor				182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date			 February 19</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    August 20</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
